      "mergeID": "671a693e79a599b82705f5be",
      "mergedPostDetails": "When avatars are loaded, be it the hidden robot, or their full avatar, if they're in a non-standing position, their voice will sound like its coming from the direction of their feet. \n\nThis only happens when the avatar is loaded, so if they're actively being downloaded, or loaded. \n\nThis /seems/ like a new issue as i haven't noticed until build 1530.\n\nIts worth noting that there's a couple older reports of similar issues, however this issue seems to be a new issue, with similar effects",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[OPEN BETA 1530] Voices are desynced from players avatars if they're laying down when loaded",
